Vendored copy of the Sitar language's Pygments lexer, from the sitar
repository (https://github.com/sitar-sim/sitar/tree/master/sitar_pygments_lexer),
so this repo's docs/requirements.txt is self-contained and doesn't need a
sibling checkout of sitar. Provides syntax highlighting for ```sitar code
blocks in this repo's own MkDocs documentation. See docs/README for how
it's installed.
